	(no_connect
		(at 260.35 314.96)
		(uuid "cb7e4f33-e193-4138-a5c5-acb675665183")
	)
	(text_box "Power tree: fused 12-24 V input with a TVS and two independent 1 A series-diode feeds. One feed powers the 5 V logic buck and analog housekeeping; the other powers the nominal 11 V backlight buck. WeAct onboard 3.3 V regulation supplies only the module, and the ESP has its own 3.3 V LDO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0.0000)
		(size 175 28)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.127)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "408a2839-8a2f-4863-a698-2892161b7bf8")
	)
	(text_box "Default: the LMR36510 generates +5V for the module and both peripheral LDOs. The WeAct onboard regulator supplies only the module, whose 3V3 outputs and VBUS remain local."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 120 165 0.0000)
		(size 140 34)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.127)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "241ae305-677c-41b6-aaa8-d6dd9bcc6658")
	)
	(text_box "J2 carries the nominal 11 V backlight/CCFL supply on the legacy +12V_BL net, a 3.3 V PWM control signal from GPIO1, and ground. GPIO1 also drives the optional Q8 low-side return through a 100 ohm gate resistor. High-current switching remains on the external inverter or backlight driver."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 240 0.0000)
		(size 180 30)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.127)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "04e957be-e00f-435a-8750-f1a9d28c708d")
	)
	(text_box "U3 is a second LMR36510 buck set to 12 V for the LCD backlight/CCFL inverter supply. It uses 47 uH, 100 k / 10 k feedback, 3x22 uF/25 V output and 22 uF/50 V + 100 nF/100 V local input. The existing U37 +12V_AO supply remains separate."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 250 250 0.0000)
		(size 210 42)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
